/*
  PlaybackControls.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0096 · PlaybackControls (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Mirrors every `t(key, default)` the web
  source (web/src/components/data-display/PlaybackControls.tsx + its TimelineScrubber / PlaybackSpeedMenu
  children) resolves, plus the native-chrome keys the web pure render has no concept of (the P4 leaf
  states, the freshness chip, and the VoiceOver labels). Entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; kept in a per-surface table
  ("PlaybackControls") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings.
*/

